            "description": "Where the comment is in its life. A draft holds its anchors from the\nmoment its author opens the composer; it is listed only to its author,\nwho can continue or discard it, and marks no text for anyone else. A\ndeleted comment is linked from no list, and has no anchors."
          }
        },
