    "description": "Readable Markdown and the same compact view for standalone and embedded use.",
    "properties": {
      "$FS": {
        "description": "The note as `index.md`: the title in the frontmatter, then the body, both\nlinked to the fields below. A filesystem save writes both back. Once an\neditor has changed the body, a save that changes it too is refused, and\nthe body is edited through the verbs below instead.",
